%% State — join request (enrolment). No UV ID claim (spec 24)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending : student submits
  [*] --> Escalated : submitted by a CR/DCR
  Pending --> Withdrawn : student withdraws
  Withdrawn --> [*]
  Pending --> Accepted : CR/DCR accepts (first wins)
  Pending --> Rejected : CR/DCR rejects with reason
  Pending --> Escalated : no action within 3 days
  Escalated --> Accepted : dept admin accepts
  Escalated --> Rejected : dept admin rejects
  Rejected --> Accepted : admin reverses an appeal
  Rejected --> [*] : student may re-apply\n(no rejection limit)
  Accepted --> Revoked : admin removes student from section (reason)
  Accepted --> Superseded : semester rollover
  Revoked --> [*]
  Superseded --> [*]
